sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Administrador
    participant View as LoginView
    participant VM as LoginViewModel
    participant Service as IAuthApiService
    participant API as Ducks.Api (REST)
    participant Store as UserSessionStore
    participant Nav as NavigationStore

    Admin->>View: Insere credenciais (E-mail e Senha)
    View->>VM: Aciona LoginCommand
    VM->>Service: LoginAsync(LoginRequestDto)
    Service->>API: POST /api/auth/login (HTTPS)
    API-->>Service: Retorna Token JWT e Status 200 OK
    Service-->>VM: LoginResponseDto (Token)
    VM->>Store: SetSession(Token, Email)
    VM->>Nav: Atualiza CurrentViewModel = DashboardViewModel
    Nav-->>View: Renderiza MainDashboardView na Janela Principal